  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food Sovereignty and Land Occupation in Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To strengthen food sovereignty and land rights of smallholder farmers, the Bangladesh Krishok Federation (BKF) will train 500 farmers/activists on land rights, climate resilience, and agroecology; facilitate 200 landless/land poor families to gain legal tenure to land for cultivation; form local farmer committees for sustainability and future mobilisation; advocate for pro-poor land reform at local and national levels; and strengthen BKF&apos;s capacity through leadership development, and improving internal systems for planning, monitoring, and communication.</narrative>
  </description>
